                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Meetayie ninye tipat, anaa enatiu apa lelo kulikae apolosak, meeta tipat napolosishore anaake, to lbae loo ng'ok enyena makewan, neitoki apolosisho to lbae loo ng'ok o lorere, eitabayie ninye ina nabo kata ake apa pee eishooyo kewan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.27",
